0,Music of Slovakia - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Slovakia,"Whilst there are traces of pre-historic musical instruments, the country has a rich heritage of folk music and mediaeval liturgical music, and from the 18th century onwards, in particular, musical life was influenced by that of Austria-Hungary.",Slovak,Indo-European
1,Slovak folk music - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slovak_folk_music,"Folk music is deeply rooted in regional traditions, leading to distinct sounds among various groups. In one region, the music predominantly features string instruments, whereas in another, it is primarily characterized by wind instruments.",Slovak,Indo-European
